This repository ships patches, an adapter, and wasm-game-framework 0.9.6.
It does not ship the leaked Source engine or retail Valve game files.

wasm-game-framework 0.9.6 is MIT-licensed. See vendor/wasm-game-framework.

Patches that modify the user-provided GPL engine tree are intended to be
applied under the same terms as that tree. Retail owner data stays on /data.
